From b1e98428c8a0f280144f117f8ada98d6331a1579 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Eric <thombelcar@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 21:03:15 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Feat: Implement Lanczos based on Ruanformigoni's code
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

An AI assisted integration of the new .comp‎ filters into gamescope: cs_bilateral_denoiser.comp, cs_ewa_lanczos.comp and cs_hdeband.comp. Based on Ruanformigoni's Bicubic Downscaling PR (#740) in upstream Gamescope.

Co-authored-by: Ruan E. Formigoni <ruanformigoni@gmail.com>
Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
